---
import Container from "@shared/components/Container.astro";
import { DISCORD_URL, PAYNOW_BUYER_AGREEMENT_URL } from "@shared/links";
import Layout from "@/layouts/Layout.astro";
---

<Layout title="Starfish Terms" description="The terms of a Starfish license">
  <Container width="narrow" class="terms">
    <h1>Starfish Terms</h1>
    <p class="updated">Last updated: November 24, 2026</p>

    <p>
      These Starfish Terms (the "Terms") form a binding agreement between you
      and the developers of Starfish ("we", "us" or "our") governing your
      purchase of a Starfish license and your use of the Starfish software
      ("Starfish"). By purchasing a license, you agree to these Terms. Licenses
      are sold by PayNow, our authorized reseller and merchant of record, and
      your payment is governed by PayNow's{" "}
      <a href={PAYNOW_BUYER_AGREEMENT_URL}>Buyer Agreement</a>.
    </p>

    <section>
      <h2>1. License Grant</h2>
      <p>
        Subject to these Terms, we grant you a personal, non-exclusive,
        non-transferable, revocable license to use Starfish. The license is
        bound to the Discord account used to purchase it and may not be sold,
        transferred, shared or assigned. Starfish limits the number of times per
        month a license may be moved to a different device.
      </p>
    </section>

    <section>
      <h2>2. Term</h2>
      <p>
        The license is granted for a one-time fee with no recurring charges and
        does not expire. It remains in effect until it is refunded or revoked
        under these Terms. If we discontinue maintenance of Starfish, we will
        release its source code with license checks removed.
      </p>
    </section>

    <section>
      <h2>3. Compatibility Guarantee and Refunds</h2>
      <p>
        We guarantee that Starfish is compatible with any Minecraft 1.8.9
        process. If Starfish does not function on your system, contact us and we
        will work with you to resolve the issue. If you choose not to wait for a
        resolution, or we are unable to resolve it within a reasonable time, you
        are entitled to a full refund. Refund requests must be made within
        fourteen (14) days of purchase. If you reported the issue within that
        period, you may request a refund for as long as we are working to
        resolve it. Refunds are issued through PayNow, and a refund terminates
        your license.
      </p>
    </section>

    <section>
      <h2>4. Assumption of Risk</h2>
      <p>
        Starfish modifies your game client, and you use it at your own risk. You
        are solely responsible for complying with the rules of any server on
        which you use it. Some servers prohibit client modifications and may
        take action against your account, and we are not liable for any such
        action. Starfish is not affiliated with, endorsed by or sponsored by
        Hypixel Inc., Mojang AB or Microsoft Corporation.
      </p>
    </section>

    <section>
      <h2>5. Third-Party Plugins</h2>
      <p>
        We develop Starfish and its official plugins. Plugins published by other
        users are third-party content for which their authors are solely
        responsible. We do not review or endorse them and accept no liability
        for them. You are responsible for understanding what a plugin does
        before installing it.
      </p>
    </section>

    <section>
      <h2>6. Termination</h2>
      <p>
        We reserve the right to revoke your license without refund if you share
        it, initiate a chargeback, or abuse Starfish or our services, including
        by attacking or overloading our services or circumventing the license
        system.
      </p>
    </section>

    <section>
      <h2>7. Disclaimer of Warranties</h2>
      <p>
        Except for the compatibility guarantee in Section 3, and to the maximum
        extent permitted by applicable law, Starfish is provided "as is" and "as
        available", without warranties of any kind, express or implied,
        including implied warranties of merchantability, fitness for a
        particular purpose and non-infringement.
      </p>
    </section>

    <section>
      <h2>8. Limitation of Liability</h2>
      <p>
        To the maximum extent permitted by applicable law, we shall not be
        liable for any indirect, incidental, special, consequential or punitive
        damages, and our total liability arising out of or relating to these
        Terms or Starfish shall not exceed the amount you paid for your license.
        Nothing in these Terms limits any rights you have under applicable law
        that cannot be waived.
      </p>
    </section>

    <section>
      <h2>9. Amendments</h2>
      <p>
        We may amend these Terms from time to time. Amendments apply only to
        purchases made after they take effect, and the date of the current
        version is shown above.
      </p>
    </section>

    <section>
      <h2>10. Severability</h2>
      <p>
        If any provision of these Terms is held unenforceable, the remaining
        provisions remain in full force and effect.
      </p>
    </section>

    <section>
      <h2>11. Contact</h2>
      <p>
        For support, refund requests or questions about these Terms, contact us
        in the <a href={DISCORD_URL}>Urchin Discord</a>.
      </p>
    </section>
  </Container>
</Layout>

<style>
  .terms {
    display: grid;
    gap: 1.5rem;
    padding-block: 4rem 6rem;
    color: var(--color-text-secondary);
    line-height: 1.7;
  }

  h1 {
    color: var(--color-text-strong);
    font-size: var(--text-2xl);
    font-weight: 600;
  }

  .updated {
    margin-top: -1rem;
    color: var(--color-text-muted);
    font-size: var(--text-sm);
  }

  section {
    display: grid;
    gap: 0.5rem;
  }

  h2 {
    color: var(--color-text);
    font-size: var(--text-base);
    font-weight: 600;
  }

  p {
    max-width: 40rem;
    text-wrap: pretty;
  }

  a {
    color: inherit;
    text-decoration: underline;
    text-decoration-color: var(--color-border-hover);
    text-underline-offset: 0.2em;

    @media (hover: hover) {
      &:hover {
        color: var(--color-text);
      }
    }
  }
</style>
